### Test Manual Timetable Creation

# Test with valid IDs (should work)
POST http://localhost:3000/timetables/manual
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Emploi du temps - IDs valides",
  "description": "Test avec des IDs qui existent",
  "entries": [
    {
      "classId": 1,
      "courseId": 1,
      "teacherId": 1,
      "classroomId": 1,
      "timeSlotId": 1
    }
  ]
}

###

# Test with invalid course ID (should fail)
POST http://localhost:3000/timetables/manual
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Emploi du temps - Course ID invalide",
  "description": "Test avec courseId qui n'existe pas",
  "entries": [
    {
      "classId": 1,
      "courseId": 999,
      "teacherId": 1,
      "classroomId": 1,
      "timeSlotId": 1
    }
  ]
}

###

# Test with invalid teacher ID (should fail)
POST http://localhost:3000/timetables/manual
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Emploi du temps - Teacher ID invalide",
  "description": "Test avec teacherId qui n'existe pas",
  "entries": [
    {
      "classId": 1,
      "subjectId": 1,
      "teacherId": 999,
      "classroomId": 1,
      "timeSlotId": 1
    }
  ]
}

